    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>bC</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cH</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>xMn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>yCO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>zH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br />If the above equation is balanced with integer coefficients, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math>&nbsp;is _______ . (Round off to the Nearest Integer).",
