  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Writing the half reaction</p><p>Reduction half reaction&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>balancing oxygen&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>balancing Hydrogen&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>balancing charge&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Oxidation half&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br />Balancing carbon</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup